          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
            From initial consultation and blueprinting to installation, commissioning, and lifetime maintenance.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>


  {/* ================================================================
      SECTION 5: ABOUT SNAPSHOT
      ================================================================ */}
  <section class="bg-[#0D1117] flex flex-col lg:flex-row min-h-[600px]">
    <div class="w-full lg:w-[55%] min-h-[400px] lg:min-h-full bg-image-placeholder relative" data-aos="fade-right">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888946425-d0fbb186a5b3?w=1000&q=80"
